  "observations": [
    "All 36 files match the recovered manifest SHA-256, byte size, dimensions and alpha extrema. No inventory discrepancy.",
    "All 36 PNGs contain genuine transparency and visible content, with visible alpha >= 12 bounds strictly inside image dimensions.",
    "The 14-family Canvas overview shows 28 individual character drawings. Full guard silhouettes and portrait identities remain legible over a checkerboard; Ghostly apparatus, Disappearing Guy microphone and Queenie mechanized body remain intact in both facing directions.",
    "The eight recovered projectiles are visible individually in the 23-motif production-renderer gallery. The four B additions are distinct, legible at native game size and unchanged after reflection except orientation.",
    "All recorded hashes of sources used by the two historical Canvas reports matched current files at review time; these remain historical captures, not newly rerun Canvas simulations.",
    "Four B projectile owners map to their dedicated PNG for every current projectile slot. Reflected-owner lookups preserve the original move motif. All four use fixed art motion and all four paths are published in ART_FILES.",
    "Renderer code chooses artwork by original move name, flips fixed art for vx < 0, uses uniform scale within declared dimensions and does not mutate projectile simulation.",
    "Low-alpha RGB residue outside silhouettes may appear in a raw viewer. The checked Canvas composites show transparent surroundings; no art regeneration or pixel edit was performed.",
    "Selection and guard files are distinct drawings; no new animation or action frame was requested or added."
  ],
